  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryInc1OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주는 주식의 양도, 담보 제공 등 처분이 제한되며, 이후에도 연결회사의 우선매수권 대상이 됩니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryInc2OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주는 연결회사가 보유 지분 전량을 제3자에게 양도하고자 할 경우, CHERRY Inc.의 최근 분기 대차대조표상 순자산가액을 기업가치로 하여 산출된 금액으로 연결회사에 매각할수 있는 풋옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryInc3OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주가 자발적 퇴사 또는 정당한 사유로 퇴사하는 경우, 상기 풋옵션은 소멸되며, 연결회사는 본 건 백업콜옵션 행사 전 최근 분기 대차대조표상 순자산가액을 기업가치로 하여 기존주주의 지분을 매입할 수 있는 콜옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryInc4OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주는 대상회사가 신주발행시 의결권 비율 유지를 위해 필요한 수의 주식을 우선 인수할수 있는 권리를 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfEkGamesInc1OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfEkGamesIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주가 제3자에게 주식을 양도하려는 경우, 연결회사는 동일한 조건으로 양도하려는 주식을 매수할 수 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfEkGamesInc2OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfEkGamesIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주는 매년 일정 경영성과 달성 시, 제 3의 평가기관을 통한 주식가치평가 혹은 상호 합의 하에 성과지표에 특정배수를 적용하여 산정한 가액으로 보유 주식 수량의 1/3을 한도로 연결회사에게 매도할 수 있는 권리를 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfEkGamesInc3OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfEkGamesIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 매년 일정 경영성과 달성 시, 제 3의 평가기관을 통한 주식가치평가 혹은 상호 합의 하에 성과지표에 특정배수를 적용하여 산정한 가액으로 기존 주주가 보유한 주식 수량의 1/3을 한도로 기존주주가 보유한 주식을 매수할 수 있는 권리를 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfEkGamesInc4OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfEkGamesIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 법률위반 등 기존주주들의 귀책사유가 발생한 경우, 기존주주에게 연결회사가 보유한 주식의 전부 또는 일부를 특정가격에 기존 주주에게 매도할 수 있는 권리를 보유 하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeInc1OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주가 제3자에게 주식을 양도하려는 경우, 연결회사는 동일한 조건으로 양도하려는 주식을 매수할 수 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeInc2OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주는 매년 일정 경영성과 달성 시, 제 3의 평가기관을 통한 주식가치평가 혹은 상호 합의 하에 성과지표에 특정배수를 적용하여 산정한 가액으로 보유 주식 수량의 1/3을 한도로 연결회사에게 매도할 수 있는 권리를 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeInc3OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 매년 일정 경영성과 달성 시, 제 3의 평가기관을 통한 주식가치평가 혹은 상호 합의 하에 성과지표에 특정배수를 적용하여 산정한 가액으로 기존 주주가 보유한 주식 수량의 1/3을 한도로 기존주주가 보유한 주식을 매수할 수 있는 권리를 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeInc4OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 법률위반 등 기존주주들의 귀책사유가 발생한 경우, 기존주주에게 연결회사가 보유한 주식의 전부 또는 일부를 기존 주주에게 매도할 수 있는 권리를 보유 하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfKindCoLtdOfTypesOfContractsMemberOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">인수 이후 실적에 연동하여 인수대금을 지급하는 조건부대가 계약을 체결하였으며, 이에 따라 1,112백만원의 부채를 인식하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfNcroquisInc1OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfNcroquisIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">특정 주주가 제3자에게 주식을 양도하려는 경우, 다른 주주들은 동일한 조건으로 함께 주식을 매도할 수 있는 공동매도권을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfNcroquisInc2OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfNcroquisIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주는 일정 경영성과 달성 시, 성과지표에 특정 배수를 적용하여 산정한 가액으로 보유 주식을 연결회사에게 매도할 수 있는 권리를 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfNcroquisInc3OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfNcroquisIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 일정 경영성과 달성 시, 성과지표에 특정 배수를 적용하여 산정한 가액으로 기존주주가 보유한 주식을 매수 할 수 있는 권리를 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited1OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주는 인수 종료일로부터 4년 경과 후 6개월 간 보유 주식 중 64.28%에 대해 최초 인수 가치 측정에 사용된 Revenue Multiple을 기준으로 산정된 가치로 양도를 요구할 수 있는 1차 풋옵션을 보유하고 있으며, 10년 경과 후 3개월 간 잔여 지분 전량에 대해 동일 방식으로 양도를 요구할 수 있는 2차 풋옵션도 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited2OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 1차 풋옵션 종료 후 6개월 이내, 2차 풋옵션 종료 후 3개월 이내에 기존 주주가 보유한 지분을 동일한 평가 방식으로 매입할 수 있는 1차 및 2차 콜옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited3OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주가 제3자에게 주식을 전량 양도하고자 할 경우, 연결회사는 동일 조건으로 우선매수권을 행사할 수 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited4OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사가 보유 지분 전량을 제3자에게 양도하고자 할 경우, 기존 주주에게 동일 조건으로 전량 동반양도를 요구할 수 있는 권리가 부여되어 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited5OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사가 제3자에게 주식을 양도하고자 할 경우, 기존 주주는 동일 조건으로 보유 지분 전량을 함께 양도할 수 있는 권리를 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited6OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주는 인수 종료일로부터 4년간 주식의 양도, 담보 제공 등 처분이 제한되며, 이후에도 연결회사의 우선매수권 대상이 됩니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited7OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주가 경영권 변경이나 경쟁사와의 이해관계가 발생할 경우, 연결회사는 Accelerated Call Option을 행사하여 잔여 지분을 즉시 인수할 수 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAb1OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAbOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">계약 체결 후 2년 후 연결회사가 보유지분 전체를 제3자에게 매각하는 경우, 다른 주주들도 동반매각에 참여하도록 요구할 수 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAb2OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAbOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">계약 체결 후 5년 후 한 명 이상의 주주가 피투자회사 지분의 60%를 매각하고자 하는 경우, 다른 주주들은 보유한 지분을 동일한 가격으로 매각에 참여할 수 있는 권리를 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAb3OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAbOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">주식선택권을 보유한 종업원은 가득 완료 및 행사 후 지분의 50%의 수량에 대해, 본 건 인수시의 주당인수가격으로 매각할 수 있는 풋옵션을 보유하고 있으며 연결회사는 같은 조건으로 매입할 수 있는 콜옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAb4OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAbOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">1차 풋옵션 :  기존주주는 보유주식의 50%까지 특정 게임 출시 후 1년간의 성과지표에 특정 배수를 적용한 가치로 매각할 수 있는 풋옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAb5OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAbOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">2차 풋옵션 : 1차 풋옵션 행사 후 남은 잔량의 주식에 대해 2023년에서 2029년까지의 성과지표 중 12개월의 최대치에 특정배수를 적용한 가치로 매각할 수 있는 풋옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAb6OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAbOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">2차 풋옵션 종료 후 연결회사는 기존 주주의 주식을 매년의 성과지표에 특정배수를 적용한 가치로 매입할 수 있는 콜옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAb7OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAbOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주가 자발적 퇴사 또는 정당한 사유로 퇴사하는 경우, 상기 풋옵션은 소멸되며, 연결회사는 본 건 백업콜옵션 행사 전 12개월의 성과지표에 특정배수를 적용한 가치로 기존주주의 지분을 매입할 수 있는 콜옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited1OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주는 인수 종료일로부터 4년 경과 후 6개월 간 보유 주식 중 64.28%에 대해 최초 인수 가치 측정에 사용된 Revenue Multiple을 기준으로 산정된 가치로 양도를 요구할 수 있는 1차 풋옵션을 보유하고 있으며, 10년 경과 후 3개월 간 잔여 지분 전량에 대해 동일 방식으로 양도를 요구할 수 있는 2차 풋옵션도 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited2OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 1차 풋옵션 종료 후 6개월 이내, 2차 풋옵션 종료 후 3개월 이내에 기존 주주가 보유한 지분을 동일한 평가 방식으로 매입할 수 있는 1차 및 2차 콜옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited3OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주가 제3자에게 주식을 전량 양도하고자 할 경우, 당사는 동일 조건으로 우선매수권을 행사할 수 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited4OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사가 보유 지분 전량을 제3자에게 양도하고자 할 경우, 기존 주주에게 동일 조건으로 전량 동반양도를 요구할 수 있는 권리가 부여되어 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited5OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사가 제3자에게 주식을 양도하고자 할 경우, 기존 주주는 동일 조건으로 보유 지분 전량을 함께 양도할 수 있는 권리를 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
